  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 mins. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the butter (for the mash) and milk to potato and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64b08e53d5b28de23e8e9e73-7e6b382d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Roughly chop tomato and brown onion.\n• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook carrot and onion until tender, 4-5 mins. Add tomato and cook, stirring, until tender, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64b08e53d5b28de23e8e9e73-3b0b3e8a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add cannellini beans, all-purpose seasoning, Italian herbs, passata, the brown sugar, salt and a splash of water to the veggies and stir until combined.\n• Reduce heat to medium and cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and stir through baby spinach and the butter (for the filling) until melted and combined. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64b08e53d5b28de23e8e9e73-9f7cfa06.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high. Transfer filling to a baking dish and top evenly with mash.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese and grill until lightly golden, 5-8 mins.\n• Divide Italian white bean pie between plates.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64b08e53d5b28de23e8e9e73-beb07150.jpeg"
    }
  ]
